flowchart TD
    Judge[Judge browser] --> CF[CloudFront HTTPS]
    CF --> Review[EC2 read-only review service]
    Review --> Snapshot[(SQLite review snapshot)]
    Operator[Private operator via IAM / SSM] --> API[FastAPI and SQLite queue]
    API --> Worker[Bounded worker]
    S3[Private S3 original inputs and weights] --> Worker
    Worker --> CV[OpenCV 5 preprocessing and diagnostics]
    CV --> Agent{Observe and select next tool}
    Agent --> Watershed[OpenCV watershed]
    Agent --> Neural[PyTorch detector]
    Watershed --> Eval[Evaluator; reference annotations enter here]
    Neural --> Eval
    Eval --> API
    API --> Snapshot
    Agent --> Human[Human inspection; no automatic enforcement]
    Worker --> Logs[CloudWatch]
    COOL[Temporary official COOL on Graviton] --> Baseline[Actual pipelines vs stock OpenCV]
    Baseline --> Snapshot
